2026-07-28T21:40:01.2686000Z +     "The duckdb tests exercise DuckDB's bundled C++ engine and are deliberately\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2686959Z +     "NOT run on CRAN. They run automatically on GitHub Actions (including\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2687877Z +     "r-universe). This keeps check time and resource usage on CRAN within\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2688878Z +     "acceptable limits and helps release duckdb in a predictable and controlled\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2689603Z +     "manner.\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2690006Z +     "\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2690724Z +     "This is intentional, not an oversight. duckdb has an extensive test suite\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2691746Z +     "that runs continuously in our own CI; see <https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-r>.\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2692453Z +     "\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2693144Z +     "To run the test suite locally, set the environment variable before checking:\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2694005Z +     "  Sys.setenv(DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS = \"true\")    # from within R, or\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2694793Z +     "  DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS=true R CMD check ...      # from the shell\n",
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2695402Z +     strrep("=", 78),
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2695863Z +     "\n"
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2696215Z +   )
2026-07-28T21:40:01.2696544Z + }
